## Workflow

- **Default**: main session orchestrates 2 agents (`developer`, `analyst`) and skills (`/verify`, `/plan-and-develop`, `/compact`).
- **Read-only research**: dispatch `analyst` (haiku) when output would be noisy.
- **Edits at risk**: dispatch `developer` (sonnet, worktree-isolated) for multi-file or breaking changes.
- **After any change**: invoke `/verify` before declaring done.
- **End of session**: invoke `/compact` to drain findings into `docs/wiki/`.

